{"schema_version": "2.0", "record_type": "finance_news_article", "article_id": "d717e6a4ef63cb216abd4713", "title": "非A 板块股票集体上涨，而华盛顿政局又为这波行情添了一把火", "url": "https://finance.sina.com.cn/stock/usstock/c/2026-11-06/doc-inixthpk5378458.shtml", "source": "新浪财经", "source_id": "sina_finance", "source_tier": "T1", "published_at": "2026-11-06T00:29:00+08:00", "crawled_at": "2026-11-06T00:36:20.727367+08:00", "status": "valid", "quality_score": 0.976, "quality_flags": [], "hotness": {"score": 82.28, "list_rank": 1, "list_size": 192, "rank_percentile": 1.0, "source_priority": 6, "source_tier": "T1", "has_engagement_metrics": true, "engagement_score": 0.0}, "engagement": {"has_any_metric": true, "available_metrics": ["comment_count"], "missing_metrics": ["read_count", "view_count", "like_count", "favorite_count", "share_count", "repost_count"], "available_metric_count": 1, "counts": {"read_count": null, "view_count": null, "comment_count": 0, "like_count": null, "favorite_count": null, "share_count": null, "repost_count": null}, "score": 0.0, "metric_source": "sina_finance_detail_html+sina_comment_api", "collected_at": "2026-11-06T00:36:20.727367+08:00", "quality_flags": [], "raw": {"sina_comment_api": {"sina_comment_count": {"total": 0, "show": 0, "thread_show": 0, "qreply_show": 0, "qreply": 0}, "api_url": "https://comment5.news.sina.com.cn/cmnt/count?format=json&newslist=cj%3Acomos-nixthpk5378458", "comment_channel": "cj", "comment_id": "comos-nixthpk5378458"}}}, "source_info": {"id": "sina_finance", "name": "新浪财经", "tier": "T1", "role": "market_news", "priority": 6, "section": "滚动新闻"}, "time_info": {"published_at": "2026-11-06T00:29:00+08:00", "published_date": "2026-11-06", "crawled_at": "2026-11-06T00:36:20.727367+08:00", "crawl_date": "2026-11-06", "timezone": "Asia/Shanghai", "age_minutes_at_crawl": 7.35, "published_after_crawl": false}, "content_info": {"title_length": 29, "content_length": 548, "has_content": true, "excerpt": "这次大选给了华尔街买入绝大多数股票的理由，但芯片股是例外。自 10 月初以来，芯片股市值已经蒸发近 4 万亿美元。 民主党拿下国会参众两院，周三 道琼斯 工业平均指数大涨 3%，创下 2025 年 4 月 9 日以来最佳单日表现；当年那次上涨，源于特朗普总统暂停实施 “解放日” 系列关祱。标普 500 指数大约四分之三的成分股在本轮行情中收涨。 苹果 、伯克希尔・哈撒韦股价收盘均创下历史新高。市场押注伊朗战争有望走向收尾，航空、住宅建筑商、零售板块应声大涨。 家得宝 、劳氏家", "author": "环球市场播报", "keywords": []}, "extraction": {"entrypoint_url": "https://finance.sina.com.cn/roll/", "raw_html_path": null, "list_rank": 1, "list_size": 192, "captured_at": "2026-11-06T00:36:20.727367+08:00", "method": "滚动新闻"}, "quality": {"status": "valid", "score": 0.976, "grade": "A", "flags": [], "review_required": false, "downstream_usable": true}, "content": "这次大选给了华尔街买入绝大多数股票的理由，但芯片股是例外。自 10 月初以来，芯片股市值已经蒸发近 4 万亿美元。 民主党拿下国会参众两院，周三 道琼斯 工业平均指数大涨 3%，创下 2025 年 4 月 9 日以来最佳单日表现；当年那次上涨，源于特朗普总统暂停实施 “解放日” 系列关祱。标普 500 指数大约四分之三的成分股在本轮行情中收涨。 苹果 、伯克希尔・哈撒韦股价收盘均创下历史新高。市场押注伊朗战争有望走向收尾，航空、住宅建筑商、零售板块应声大涨。 家得宝 、劳氏家居走出 2022 年 11 月以来最强单日表现。 芯片板块走势则截然相反。费城半导体指数周三下跌 3%，进一步加深新一轮熊市； 高通 财报公布之后，周四芯片股再度下挫。 这次板块轮动并非大选才开启，大选只是加速了这一进程。 美银证券股票策略师萨维塔・苏布拉马尼亚在一份美银全球研究报告中写道：10 月标普 500 指数仅下跌 0.9%，但 “市场内部的板块轮动极其剧烈”。76% 的标普 500 成分股跑赢指数，这是美银自 1986 年统计以来最强的行情广度；等权重版标普 500 相对常规市值加权版指数的超额收益，创下 2009 年 4 月之后最大差值。 芯片股自 10 月 6 日以来已蒸发 3.8 万亿美元市值", "author": "环球市场播报", "section": "滚动新闻", "keywords": [], "hot_features": {"source_prominence": {"list_rank": 1, "list_size": 192, "source_priority": 6, "source_tier": "T1", "entrypoint": "https://finance.sina.com.cn/roll/", "captured_at": "2026-11-06T00:36:20.727367+08:00"}, "engagement_metrics": {"read_count": null, "view_count": null, "comment_count": 0, "like_count": null, "favorite_count": null, "share_count": null, "repost_count": null, "collected_at": "2026-11-06T00:36:20.727367+08:00", "source": "sina_finance_detail_html+sina_comment_api", "available_fields": ["comment_count"], "missing_fields": ["read_count", "view_count", "like_count", "favorite_count", "share_count", "repost_count"], "quality_flags": [], "raw": {"sina_comment_api": {"sina_comment_count": {"total": 0, "show": 0, "thread_show": 0, "qreply_show": 0, "qreply": 0}, "api_url": "https://commen