{"schema_version": "2.0", "record_type": "finance_news_article", "article_id": "3ba0a87998fc181831aec52b", "title": "民主党大胜引发市场对合并前景、AI建设担忧，SpaceX与特斯拉股价大跌", "url": "https://finance.sina.com.cn/stock/usstock/c/2026-11-06/doc-inixthpq9238119.shtml", "source": "新浪财经", "source_id": "sina_finance", "source_tier": "T1", "published_at": "2026-11-06T00:24:03+08:00", "crawled_at": "2026-11-06T00:36:20.727367+08:00", "status": "valid", "quality_score": 0.976, "quality_flags": [], "hotness": {"score": 87.5166, "list_rank": 2, "list_size": 192, "rank_percentile": 0.9948, "source_priority": 6, "source_tier": "T1", "has_engagement_metrics": true, "engagement_score": 1.8062}, "engagement": {"has_any_metric": true, "available_metrics": ["comment_count"], "missing_metrics": ["read_count", "view_count", "like_count", "favorite_count", "share_count", "repost_count"], "available_metric_count": 1, "counts": {"read_count": null, "view_count": null, "comment_count": 3, "like_count": null, "favorite_count": null, "share_count": null, "repost_count": null}, "score": 1.8062, "metric_source": "sina_finance_detail_html+sina_comment_api", "collected_at": "2026-11-06T00:36:20.727367+08:00", "quality_flags": [], "raw": {"sina_comment_api": {"sina_comment_count": {"total": 3, "show": 3, "thread_show": 1, "qreply_show": 0, "qreply": 0}, "api_url": "https://comment5.news.sina.com.cn/cmnt/count?format=json&newslist=cj%3Acomos-nixthpq9238119", "comment_channel": "cj", "comment_id": "comos-nixthpq9238119"}}}, "source_info": {"id": "sina_finance", "name": "新浪财经", "tier": "T1", "role": "market_news", "priority": 6, "section": "滚动新闻"}, "time_info": {"published_at": "2026-11-06T00:24:03+08:00", "published_date": "2026-11-06", "crawled_at": "2026-11-06T00:36:20.727367+08:00", "crawl_date": "2026-11-06", "timezone": "Asia/Shanghai", "age_minutes_at_crawl": 12.3, "published_after_crawl": false}, "content_info": {"title_length": 36, "content_length": 593, "has_content": true, "excerpt": "SpaceX 与 特斯拉 股价周四延续跌势，两家公司均下跌约 9%。本周民主党拿下参众两院控制权之后，这两家埃隆・马斯克旗下企业遭到重挫。市场担忧，美国数据中心建设将遭遇监管阻碍，同时两家公司之间的合并愿景也蒙上阴影。 担忧的核心导火索来自得州的民主党胜选。SpaceX 与特斯拉的总部均坐落于此。该州州长职位由民主党拿下，同时詹姆斯・塔拉里科赢得该州联邦参议员席位；大选之前，马斯克曾和塔拉里科在社交媒体上激烈论战。 约克维尔机构周四撰文表示：“我们依旧认为 SpaceX 与特", "author": "环球市场播报", "keywords": []}, "extraction": {"entrypoint_url": "https://finance.sina.com.cn/roll/", "raw_html_path": null, "list_rank": 2, "list_size": 192, "captured_at": "2026-11-06T00:36:20.727367+08:00", "method": "滚动新闻"}, "quality": {"status": "valid", "score": 0.976, "grade": "A", "flags": [], "review_required": false, "downstream_usable": true}, "content": "SpaceX 与 特斯拉 股价周四延续跌势，两家公司均下跌约 9%。本周民主党拿下参众两院控制权之后，这两家埃隆・马斯克旗下企业遭到重挫。市场担忧，美国数据中心建设将遭遇监管阻碍，同时两家公司之间的合并愿景也蒙上阴影。 担忧的核心导火索来自得州的民主党胜选。SpaceX 与特斯拉的总部均坐落于此。该州州长职位由民主党拿下，同时詹姆斯・塔拉里科赢得该州联邦参议员席位；大选之前，马斯克曾和塔拉里科在社交媒体上激烈论战。 约克维尔机构周四撰文表示：“我们依旧认为 SpaceX 与特斯拉合并存在实现可能性，但如今华盛顿与得州整体政治格局转向民主党蓝营，2027 年想要完成这笔交易，监管道路会变得艰难得多。” 马斯克在上个月 SpaceX 财报电话会上表示，他认为 SpaceX 和特斯拉合并是个不错的构想，并透露两家企业正在探讨潜在交易。 今年早些时候，马斯克还宣布在得州动工建设大型半导体制造基地 Terafab，未来为 SpaceX、特斯拉供应芯片。 市场担忧数据中心建设节奏放缓，同样打压了总部位于得州的 SpaceX。该公司正越来越多地把 AI 算力作为收入来源。 艾夫斯表示，尽管大型科技企业与超大规模云厂商 2027 年资本开支仍将轻松突破 1 万亿美元，但到 2028 年， 增速会出现明显回落 。受当前政治格局影响，尤其是得州的政策环境，数据中心建设推进速度会显著变慢。", "author": "环球市场播报", "section": "滚动新闻", "keywords": [], "hot_features": {"source_prominence": {"list_rank": 2, "list_size": 192, "source_priority": 6, "source_tier": "T1", "entrypoint": "https://finance.sina.com.cn/roll/", "captured_at": "2026-11-06T00:36:20.727367+08:00"}, "engagement_metrics": {"read_count": null, "view_count": null, "comment_count": 3, "like_count": null, "favorite_count": null, "share_count": null, "repost_count": null, "collected_at": "2026-11-06T00:36:20.727367+08:00", "source": "sina_finance_detail_html+sina_comment_api", "available_fields": ["comment_count"], "missing_fields": ["read_count", "view_count", "like_count", "favorite_count", "share_count", "repost_count"], "quality_flags": [], "raw": {"sina_comment_api": {"sina_comment_count": {"total": 3, "show": 3, "thread_show"